'''Blood of the Karui''' is a [[unique]] {{il|Sanctified Life Flask}}. 

==Mechanics==
It first recovers the life as a regular flask would do, and at the end of the flask duration - if you are still missing life - it will recover your entire missing life pool (meaning that if the initial recovery heals you to your max life, the secondary effect will not take place at the end of the flask duration).

{{Item acquisition}}

