Moreover, during version 3.13.X, {{il|Fateful Meeting}} can grant a random double-influenced league-specific unique item including flask. This bug has been fixed in version 3.14.0, so that influenced version of Blood of the Karui are legacy too. There is no actual in-game benefit to use influenced flask, however. Player cannot use [[Influenced Exalted Orb]] to create an influenced flask base either.

